{"id":39,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"敬天愛人の精神で人間力を育てる","feature_description":"九州学院中学校・高等学校は、キリスト教精神に基づき、「敬天愛人」を教育の柱に掲げる学校です。学習、礼拝、学校行事、部活動を通して、知性だけでなく感謝や思いやり、社会に貢献する心を育てます。中高一貫の環境で基礎学力を固め、自分の目標に向けて努力を継続する姿勢を大切にしています。公式サイトの紹介内容をもとに整理してまとめています。","clubs":[{"id":565,"name":"男子バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kyugaku.ed.jp/jhs/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":566,"name":"女子バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kyugaku.ed.jp/jhs/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":567,"name":"男子バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kyugaku.ed.jp/jhs/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":568,"name":"女子バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kyugaku.ed.jp/jhs/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":569,"name":"ハンドボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kyugaku.ed.jp/jhs/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":570,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kyugaku.ed.jp/jhs/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":571,"name":"軟式野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kyugaku.ed.jp/jhs/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":572,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kyugaku.ed.jp/jhs/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":573,"name":"柔道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kyugaku.ed.jp/jhs/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":574,"name":"空手道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kyugaku.ed.jp/jhs/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":575,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kyugaku.ed.jp/jhs/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":576,"name":"硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://kyugaku.ed.jp/jhs/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":577,"name":"吹奏楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://kyugaku.ed.jp/jhs/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":578,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://kyugaku.ed.jp/jhs/life/club/","ve